+| **Multiple drinks + same-item overlap** | `test_drinks_and_meal_contribute_exactly_once` | 2 drinks → exactly 2 measurements (150, 330 ml), 2 beverage links, 3 items, totals = 542 + 124.5 + 141.9 kcal |
