+## 6. Release Checks
+
+After cutover (P2/P3), verify:
+
+### 6.1 One Drink = One Volume + One Nutrition
+
+```bash
+# Log a drink via the unified path
+curl -X POST http://localhost:8090/meals/from-text-intelligent \
+  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
