++# R2 — Shim Adapter Integration Evidence
++
++Date: 2026-09-09
++Branch: `feature/meal-liquid-idempotency` (isolated)
++Status: **shim-adapter phase implemented + integration-proven; MCP/API propagation not yet done.**
