+++- `conversationId` = `msg.chat.id` (the chat), possibly with a `:topic:<id>` suffix.
+++- `messageId` = `msg.message_id` (chat-scoped).
+++- `update_id` is **not exposed to plugin hooks** → excluded from consumption
