+++# T1 — Trusted Ingress Vertical Slice: Evidence
+++
+++Date: 2026-09-09
+++Branch: `feature/meal-liquid-idempotency` (isolated)
+++Status: **vertical slice implemented and proven on an Alembic-built database.**
